Zero-config selection and availability disclosure, failure envelopes for every
originating boundary, the pinned-purge refusal, mutation replay scope versus the
repair-apply key, the ScopeDocumentV1 scope-policy comparison axis, the repair
descriptor projection, and the D9 extension check against the inherited artifact.
"""

